	(symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 70 85 0) (unit 1) (uuid "r-trip-scale-alt-012") (property "Reference" "R7H" (at 70 88 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)))) (property "Value" "DNP 20k 0.1% — scaled VCSRC alt" (at 70 81 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)))) (property "Footprint" "Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric" (at 70 79 0) (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (hide yes))) )
	(symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 70 92 0) (unit 1) (uuid "r-trip-scale-alt2-013") (property "Reference" "R7J" (at 70 95 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)))) (property "Value" "DNP 100k 0.1% — divider lower" (at 70 91 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)))) (property "Footprint" "Resistor_SMD:R_0805_2012Metric" (at 70 89 0) (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (hide yes))) )
	(text "DAC_TRIP (AD5764 ChD via OPA140 buffer unity-gain) generates Vtrip = 1.2-1.5x * Vc_reg. Threshold table: 10mA->150%@Vs25mV, 100uA->150%@50mV, 10uA->130%, 100nA->120% (IR-08 tolerant)." (at 10 100 0) (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left)))
	(text "Tolerance stack (worst): shunt 0.1% + DAC INL 305uV + ADA4522 offset 5uV + TLV3501 Vos 6.5mV + hyst 6mV = ~6.5% @100mV FS, 26% @25mV. Hence loose threshold mandatory — supervisor not regulator." (at 10 104 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))

