	(text "U7A TLV3501 (SOT-23-6, 4.5ns, rail-to-rail, push-pull) — IN+ = amplified shunt (ADA4522 gain 25/50/100x after shunt), IN- = Vtrip. Upper threshold for source, lower via second TLV3501 (dual) for sink. Outputs ORed via diode-OR to FAST_TRIP." (at 10 132 0) (effects (font (size 0.8 0.8)) (justify left)))
	(text "Supply: +5V_A decoupled 100nF+4.7uF. Input CM includes GND. Vos 6.5mV max accounted in threshold. Hyst 6mV + 2us blanking (R 1k + C 2.2nF) rejects C*dV/dt inrush on range change." (at 10 136 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))

	; ─── Section D: Latch / Disable logic ───
	(text "D — Latch / Disable logic: FAST_TRIP OR SENSE_OPEN OR POR -> ENABLE OFF, latched, firmware CLEAR only when safe" (at 10 145 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (thickness 0.2))))
	(text "SR Latch: U7C SN74LVC1G74 / MAX16054 (POR debounce only, NOT FAST_TRIP — FAST_TRIP uses 74LVC1G74 async) or cross-coupled NAND (SN74LVC2G00). Inputs: SET = FAST_TRIP | SENSE_OPEN | POR (active-high OR via diode-OR + 10k pull-down). RESET = FW_CLEAR (MCU GPIO pulsed, only when no fault + dwell >10ms). Q drives LT1970 ENABLE low + load switch OFF. Qb drives FAULT_LED + MCU FAULT_IRQ." (at 10 149 0) (effects (font (size 0.7 0.7)) (justify left)))
